BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d7348615dcf33b7317202f69@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T060828Z
SUMMARY:BAG-A-BAT & ICE CREAM SUNDAES
LOCATION:St. Patrick's County Park: Harvest Room | 50651 Laurel Road South 
 Bend\, IN 46637 | South Bend\, IN 46637
DESCRIPTION:Discover the nocturnal world of Indiana's flying mammal with ba
 t Biologist Jeremy Sheets. We will begin with an indoor presentation abou
 t bats found in Indiana\, followed by examining bats as they are caught i
 n the mist nets. Then enjoy an ice cream sundae with toppings pollinated 
 by fruit bats. Registration and payment required by Tuesday\, September 1
 .\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/bag-a-bat-ice-cream
 -sundaes/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/bag-a-bat-ice-cream-sundaes/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260903T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260903T210000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
