 Steve Million on keys and Tim Davis on drums\, the trio will perform jazz
  standards as well as original compositions that blend jazz traditions wi
 th contemporary influences\, creating a dynamic and conversational musica
 l experience.\n\nEmma Taylor – bass and vocals\n\nSteve Million - keys\
 n\nTim Davis - drums\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/
 emma-taylor-trio/
