BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2e2adace48a9286dbc8215f5@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T060828Z
SUMMARY:MONIKA HERZIG ACOUSTIC PROJECT
LOCATION:Merrimans’ Playhouse | 401 E. Colfax Ave.\, Suite 135 | South Be
 nd\, IN 46617
DESCRIPTION:Composer and pianist Monika Herzig leads her quartet featuring 
 guitarist Peter Kienle in a program centered on original compositions fro
 m her latest release\, Transparent (2026)\, alongside selections from her
  extensive catalog of original recordings spanning more than two decades.
  Her music blends contemporary jazz with lyrical composition\, inventive 
 improvisation\, and diverse musical influences\, creating a distinctive a
 rtistic voice that continues to evolve through each recording project. Fe
 aturing original works by Herzig and selected compositions by guitarist P
 eter Kienle\, the ensemble balances thoughtfully crafted compositions wit
 h dynamic ensemble interaction and spontaneous improvisation.\n\nMonika H
 erzig - piano\n\nPeter Kienle - bass\n\nJohn Valdez - drums\n\nMore Info:
  https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/monika-herzig-acoustic-project/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/monika-herzig-acoustic-project/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260903T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260903T210000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:840ce1fef048ddaf41f5e47d@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T060828Z
SUMMARY:OBSESSION (2025)
LOCATION:DeBartolo Performing Arts Center\, 100 Performing Arts Center | No
 tre Dame\, 46556
DESCRIPTION:New at the Browning Directed by Curry Barker With Michael Johns
 ton\, Inde Navarrette\, Cooper Tomlinson Rated R\, 109 minutes\, DCP When
  a film is made for less than $1\,000\,000 and makes over half a billion 
 dollars at the box office\, then it's a safe call that society is at some
  level obsessed with it. What made and continues to make this story about
  burgeoning romance that grows into something horrific such a cultural to
 uchstone? While unpacking that\, either come see again or catch up with i
 ngénue Curry Barker's story of a wish for true love that pitches into a 
 truly scary relationship\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/eve
 nts/obsession-2025/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/obsession-2025/
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260905
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260906
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
