 th the South Bend Cubs on September 3 as we celebrate International Caber
 net Day with specialty wine-tasting-style experience! This exclusive tick
 et package includes a game ticket on the United Federal Credit Union Roof
 top\, a commemorative South Bend Cubs wine glass\, access to a two-hour a
 ll-you-can-eat buffet\, five 2-oz samples of each featured wine\, and one
  complimentary drink ticket to redeem at the rooftop bar. Gates open at 6
 :00 p.m.\, with the buffet available from 6:00 p.m.- 8:00 p.m.\n\nGame Hi
 ghlights:\n\nThirsty Thursday\n\nEnjoy $3 fountain sodas (24 oz.) and dom
 estic draft beer (16 oz.) all game long.\n\nTri-Campus College Night\n\nW
 elcoming students from the University of Notre Dame\, Holy Cross College\
 , and St. Mary's College.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/ev
 ents/south-bend-cubs-vs-cedar-rapids-college-night/
